1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,500
There's a story behind every marriage.

2
00:00:32,531 --> 00:00:37,390
A 28 year old woman and a 28 year old man
that look normal to others,

3
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:39,808
met 3 years ago
through introduction from a mutual friend.

4
00:00:40,787 --> 00:00:43,186
It's time now to make decisions.

5
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,900
All the calculations regarding this man are over.

6
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:47,544
Timing is the only thing left now.

7
00:00:47,544 --> 00:00:51,109
I decided that I want to marry the man
who is in front of me at this moment.

8
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,900
Can we get married?

9
00:00:55,234 --> 00:00:57,045
Okay... good good.

10
00:00:57,046 --> 00:00:59,781
Look this way... there we go.

11
00:01:00,592 --> 00:01:01,681
Okay!

12
00:01:08,383 --> 00:01:09,607
Okay!

13
00:01:11,017 --> 00:01:12,504
These pictures look cheap.

14
00:01:12,505 --> 00:01:14,474
Is that the best you can do?

15
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,200
Let's do it again.

16
00:01:28,612 --> 00:01:30,896
- How does the pasta taste?
- It's delicious.

17
00:01:34,534 --> 00:01:37,819
- Is the pizza to your liking?
- Yes, thank you.

18
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,710
- How is the dessert?
- It's delicious.

19
00:01:46,999 --> 00:01:49,824
- Is it good?
- We just started eating.

20
00:01:49,825 --> 00:01:52,886
The bread wasn't baked long enough.
Its not crunchy enough.

21
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,747
How it's baked can vary.

22
00:01:54,747 --> 00:01:57,861
But the dessert today is killer.
Wait for it, okay?

23
00:02:07,513 --> 00:02:09,327
Here, today's highlight!

24
00:02:09,328 --> 00:02:11,363
It doesn't look like
there's anything special about it.

25
00:02:11,364 --> 00:02:12,702
We've had this before

26
00:02:12,702 --> 00:02:14,654
and the ice cream doesn't look
like it's anything special either.

27
00:02:14,655 --> 00:02:17,475
I think you were born with special skills
to bring down people.

28
00:02:17,476 --> 00:02:20,514
Ki Joong... I think it would be more
helpful if you'd just leave.

29
00:02:20,515 --> 00:02:22,411
I got it, good luck.

30
00:02:23,055 --> 00:02:25,899
Star with the ice cream first Hae Yoon...
even though it's nothing special.

31
00:02:27,781 --> 00:02:29,851
- Do you think he's upset?
- No, it's okay.

32
00:02:54,787 --> 00:02:55,860
What's wrong, Hae Yoon?

33
00:02:56,801 --> 00:02:59,465
Hae Yoon! Hae Yoon!

34
00:02:59,465 --> 00:03:00,764
I think she's choking on the ring!
119... 119!!!

35
00:03:00,764 --> 00:03:04,553
- 119... 119!
Move aside, I saw something like this on TV.

36
00:03:08,611 --> 00:03:09,694
Move over!

37
00:03:18,801 --> 00:03:20,035
Are you okay, Hae Yoon?

38
00:03:28,515 --> 00:03:32,257
Episode 1: Women's dream proposal.

39
00:03:53,345 --> 00:03:55,058
So you planned it today, didn't you?

40
00:03:55,059 --> 00:03:57,380
This is the second thing I have planned. What if I ruin it again?

41
00:03:57,882 --> 00:03:59,093
What are you going to do?

42
00:03:59,094 --> 00:04:00,981
What do you think we're going to do?
What is there to do in a hotel?

43
00:04:01,331 --> 00:04:02,457
You want to sleep with me?

44
00:04:02,458 --> 00:04:05,714
With all the respect I have showed you,
I hope you make a decision too.

45
00:04:06,215 --> 00:04:07,753
First let me look at the room.

46
00:04:07,754 --> 00:04:10,148
I want to see just how much
you think of me.

47
00:05:03,272 --> 00:05:04,694
Do you like it?

48
00:05:05,354 --> 00:05:06,783
Yeah.

49
00:05:18,343 --> 00:05:20,060
Marry me.

50
00:05:21,601 --> 00:05:25,255
Can you make me a promise?
That you'll always be honest with me?

51
00:05:26,206 --> 00:05:29,650
I will always be honest with you as
I have been since the first day I met you.

52
00:05:31,865 --> 00:05:33,966
