53
00:05:33,967 --> 00:05:36,039
Simple and without any flair.

54
00:05:52,011 --> 00:05:53,454
I love you.

55
00:05:56,443 --> 00:05:58,124
Let's love each other forever.

56
00:06:51,548 --> 00:06:52,869
