60
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:03,100
Then go ahead and buy me one.
Lets see what you're capable of.

61
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:05,494
-But first, clean that up.
- I have to clean it up?

62
00:07:05,494 --> 00:07:06,460
Then do I need to be the one to clean it up?

63
