I'm really confused.

84
00:07:57,036 --> 00:07:58,097
You mention love when the lamp breaks

85
00:07:58,097 --> 00:07:59,306
and you mention marriage
when we're taking about about love...

86
00:07:59,307 --> 00:08:00,805
