87
00:08:00,806 --> 00:08:04,524
Ever since Jung Hoon told me that he was
proposing to Hae Yoon, I've been envious.

88
00:08:04,525 --> 00:08:06,944
I want to celebrate anniversaries
just like all the other women.

89
00:08:06,945 --> 00:08:08,232
and be able to lean on my man.

90
00:08:08,233 --> 00:08:09,843
That means you've changed.

91
