Fragile old women don't appeal to me.

104
00:08:52,688 --> 00:08:54,535
Seriously... now tears?

105
00:08:56,051 --> 00:08:57,703
I guess we've reached the end of our road.

106
00:08:59,189 --> 00:09:00,845
Let's take some time out to think.

107
00:09:13,975 --> 00:09:15,623
