178
00:12:56,529 --> 00:12:57,857
I have the day off tomorrow

179
00:12:57,857 --> 00:12:59,630
and I was feeling a little down, so I called her over

180
00:12:59,631 --> 00:13:02,079
Start acting your age. You think you're still young?

181
