Aren't I cool? Attractive? You've fallen for me, haven't you?

210
00:14:29,819 --> 00:14:32,509
Aunt Deul Rae, let go of me.- If I let go, then I'm dead.

211
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:33,575
You lead the way

