00:16:00,994 --> 00:16:03,808
- What are you murmuring?
- There was a call from your house, director.

239
00:16:03,809 --> 00:16:05,998
- She wants you to call back.
- Alright.

240
00:16:05,998 --> 00:16:08,426
-Don't just say alright call her back

241
00:16:08,427 --> 00:16:11,109
I got into trouble last time because
she thought that I didn't tell you about it.

242
00:16:11,110 --> 00:16:12,385
Okay

243
00:16:12,386 --> 00:16:14,858
Let's all go out for dinner tonight since we've worked hard today.

244
00:16:14,859 --> 00:16:16,818
- Make the reservations, okay?
- Okay.

245
00:16:16,819 --> 00:16:19,065
But no shots, okay?

246
00:16:19,065 --> 00:16:21,167
You have a clever imagination. I am just going to eat.

247
00:16:36,272 --> 00:16:38,256
I don't even know how many showers I've had today

248
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:47,305
If you didn't follow me before, you would have died in my hands.

249
00:16:47,848 --> 00:16:51,108
- I like you a lot.
- I like that about you.

250
00:16:51,143 --> 00:16:53,930
- Do you like this too?
- It tickles!

251
00:16:53,965 --> 00:16:55,279
Does it tickle?

252
00:17:04,590 --> 00:17:07,518
Hold on! Hold on!

253
00:17:07,518 --> 00:17:09,064
I need to check whose calling.
Unni

254
00:17:09,064 --> 00:17:10,656
Eonni (Sister/Older Sister)

255
00:17:11,758 --> 00:17:13,082
What?

256
00:17:13,083 --> 00:17:14,643
You are with Jung Hoon, right?

257
00:17:14,644 --> 00:17:15,909
How did you know?

258
00:17:15,910 --> 00:17:17,416
Mom told me

259
00:17:17,417 --> 00:17:18,643
What?!

260
00:17:19,346 --> 00:17:21,087
Mom's going there right now

261
00:17:21,088 --> 00:17:23,341
I felt sorry so I'm telling you in advance

262
00:17:27,996 --> 00:17:29,692
What's wrong?
My mom is coming.

263
00:17:29,693 --> 00:17:31,344
Hurry up and get dressed before she barges in here.

264
00:17:31,345 --> 00:17:33,970
So what if she come's we're getting married anyway.

265
00:17:33,971 --> 00:17:35,438
My mom doesn't like you

266
00:17:36,206 --> 00:17:37,281
Why?

267
00:17:37,281 --> 00:17:38,678
She has very high expectations of me.

268
00:17:38,678 --> 00:17:40,659
She is different from other mothers. She is very greedy.

269
00:17:40,660 --> 00:17:42,573
Why didn't you tell me?

270
00:17:42,574 --> 00:17:44,863
What?
That your mom doesn't like me

271
00:17:44,864 --> 00:17:48,040
It would only upset you. I don't like it when you're upset.

272
00:17:48,075 --> 00:17:52,949
-And I don't think my mom not liking you, is a reason for me not to marry you.

273
00:17:53,874 --> 00:17:55,250
Let's hurry up and go

274
00:17:55,251 --> 00:17:56,349
Let's just face her.

275
00:17:56,350 --> 00:17:57,849
We have to meet anyways

276
00:17:57,849 --> 00:17:58,831
Let's just face her now.

277
00:17:58,832 --> 00:18:00,727
-You're saying that because you don't know her

278
00:18:00,728 --> 00:18:02,049
Do you know what she was
like with my sister?

279
00:18:18,231 --> 00:18:19,302
Who is it?

280
00:18:24,676 --> 00:18:25,873
Who is it?

281
00:18:27,293 --> 00:18:28,743
It's room service

282
00:18:35,901 --> 00:18:36,982
Who are you?

283
00:18:38,139 --> 00:18:39,825
Why are you doing this?

284
00:18:41,574 --> 00:18:42,974
Mom...

285
00:18:43,955 --> 00:18:45,563
You're crazy

286
00:18:45,564 --> 00:18:47,040
Is this how I raised you?

287
00:18:47,041 --> 00:18:49,495
I raised you up with all I had without a husband.

288
00:18:49,496 --> 00:18:51,272
How dare you with a married man!

289
00:18:51,273 --> 00:18:54,434
I'd rather you just die instead!
Die Die

290
00:18:54,435 --> 00:18:57,409
Calm down. It's all my fault mother

291
00:18:58,604 --> 00:19:00,161
Why am I your mother?

292
00:19:00,162 --> 00:19:01,929
Are you going to marry my daughter?

293
00:19:03,601 --> 00:19:06,066
Judging from you not replying, you just played with her.

294
00:19:06,067 --> 00:19:07,737
- No I did not.
-How are you going to take responsibility then?

295
00:19:08,430 --> 00:19:09,766
Give me some time.

296
00:19:09,767 --> 00:19:11,784
I have nothing to be scared of in the world.

297
00:19:11,785 --> 00:19:13,673
There's nothing I wouldn't do for my child!

298
00:19:13,674 --> 00:19:15,331
Don't think that you can just toy with her!

299
00:19:15,332 --> 00:19:17,514
Just because she didn't get proper education
and there's no man in our household.

300
00:19:17,515 --> 00:19:21,888
I will go to the end to destroy the bastard who hurts my child.

301
00:19:35,786 --> 00:19:38,823
- I really don't know her room number.
- I'm sure she's in a suite.

302
00:19:38,824 --> 00:19:39,944
Don't you think I know that girl?

303
00:19:39,944 --> 00:19:41,337
She needs the best when it comes to her sleeping quarters.

304
00:19:41,338 --> 00:19:43,425
- What did you say his name was?
- Who?

305
00:19:43,426 --> 00:19:44,932
- Who do you think I'm talking about?
- Ha Jung Hoon.

306
00:19:49,303 --> 00:19:52,645
Excuse me. I'm looking for my daughter and son-in-law but

307
00:19:52,646 --> 00:19:55,229
I don't know what number room she is in

308
00:19:55,230 --> 00:19:57,518
Nowadays I forget what I hear quickly.

309
00:19:57,519 --> 00:19:59,547
The person's name? - Ha Jung Hoon.

310
00:20:00,718 --> 00:20:02,985
If that person isn't there then, Jung Hye yoon.

311
00:20:04,558 --> 00:20:06,103
They've checked out

312
00:20:06,502 --> 00:20:08,552
She came today and left today?

313
00:20:10,229 --> 00:20:11,908
She checked out just a moment ago.

314
00:20:13,936 --> 00:20:15,565
This girl!

315
00:20:29,033 --> 00:20:30,352
Will you be okay?

316
00:20:30,353 --> 00:20:32,200
Are you going to be okay?

317
00:20:32,201 --> 00:20:34,873
I'm sorry I didn't tell you about my mother and sister.

318
00:20:34,874 --> 00:20:38,490
I showed you everything that I considered embarrassing today.

319
00:20:39,172 --> 00:20:40,802
Thank you

320
00:20:40,803 --> 00:20:42,498
My hot temper,

321
00:20:42,498 --> 00:20:44,992
When I was little, I always held it in no matter what when my mom was angry.

322
00:20:44,993 --> 00:20:46,554
I got hit a lot too.

323
00:20:46,555 --> 00:20:47,603
It's weird right?

324
00:20:47,604 --> 00:20:49,860
When I'm around you I don't want to hold back

325
00:20:49,861 --> 00:20:51,807
I'm trying to fix it.

326
00:20:52,299 --> 00:20:54,024
It just means that you're that much more comfortable with me.

327
00:20:54,025 --> 00:20:57,260
I'm a man who's crazy about your hot temper and about you pointing everything out.

328
00:20:59,885 --> 00:21:02,063
My parents want you to come over and greet
them officially as a daughter-in-law to be.

329
00:21:02,064 --> 00:21:04,416
You're driven. I like that too.

330
00:21:04,417 --> 00:21:06,307
Thank you for liking it.

331
00:21:07,099 --> 00:21:09,704
What should I bring when I go? I don't have anything to wear either.

332
00:21:09,704 --> 00:21:12,189
- Should I buy you clothes?
- I am not asking you to buy me clothes.

333
00:21:12,190 --> 00:21:13,524
I want to buy you clothes.

334
00:21:13,525 --> 00:21:15,118
Let's meet tomorrow at the mall to buy clothes.

335
00:21:15,118 --> 00:21:16,214
Let's go to our house

336
00:21:17,432 --> 00:21:18,732
Okay, I'll call you

337
00:21:21,665 --> 00:21:23,232
Don't get out of the car.

338
00:21:38,268 --> 00:21:39,688
Why did you call at this time?

339
00:21:40,199 --> 00:21:42,326
Ki Joong, I really feel funny.

340
00:21:42,327 --> 00:21:44,253
I don't think I can home like this.

341
00:22:08,758 --> 00:22:08,910
I'm against this marriage.

342
00:22:08,910 --> 00:22:10,080
I'm against this marriage.

343
00:22:10,087 --> 00:22:11,830
Hyung, you're hostile about all marriage so

344
00:22:11,830 --> 00:22:13,029
your opposition doesn't count.

345
00:22:48,291 --> 00:22:50,984
I can't even do this anymore. It wasn't like this during Hae Jin's time.

346
00:22:50,985 --> 00:22:52,938
Why do you have to be like this? So lowly.

347
00:22:52,939 --> 00:22:56,041
That's why I'm saying that you're just old in age but still a child.

348
00:22:56,042 --> 00:22:57,602
What do we have?

349
00:22:57,602 --> 00:22:59,567
Do we have a dependable background or money?

350
00:22:59,567 --> 00:23:03,093
Fortunately since we're women, being young and pretty, we can bet on those things.

351
00:23:03,094 --> 00:23:05,386
Just because you feel that way, you think that Hye Yoon will listen to you?

352
00:23:05,387 --> 00:23:07,076
That's why I went chasing after her today.

353
00:23:07,077 --> 00:23:09,178
How much must the man be turned off after meeting me?

354
00:23:09,179 --> 00:23:10,405
Would you like this kind of mother-in-law?

355
00:23:10,406 --> 00:23:12,224
Today is different than with Hae Jin.

356
00:23:12,225 --> 00:23:15,100
In Hae Jin's day I went to hold onto him and today I went to break them up.

357
00:23:15,770 --> 00:23:18,794
Wow the way your head works is really shocking with a capital "S".

358
00:23:18,795 --> 00:23:21,449
If there is marriage there needs to be love

359
00:23:21,450 --> 00:23:23,703
Love? Feed that to the dogs!

360
00:23:24,144 --> 00:23:26,470
Look at me. Was I this rough from the start?

361
00:23:26,471 --> 00:23:28,240
I changed to become like this because I met your brother-in-law.

362
00:23:28,241 --> 00:23:30,756
That's not it. Unnie, you were originally ferocious.

363
00:23:31,444 --> 00:23:34,176
Anyways, I'm not going to let my daughters' live like me

364
00:23:34,177 --> 00:23:36,130
Especially Hye yoon. I've invested so much in her...

365
00:23:36,131 --> 00:23:38,152
I'll make her meet a good man and fix her fate.

366
00:23:38,153 --> 00:23:39,522
She more than has that right.

367
00:23:50,697 --> 00:23:52,153
Don't hit my face

368
00:23:52,847 --> 00:23:54,499
Are you saying that you must follow though with this wedding?

369
00:23:54,500 --> 00:23:57,517
- Yes
- Aigoo who says you can?

370
00:23:57,518 --> 00:23:58,911
Who told you to get married?

371
00:23:58,912 --> 00:24:00,111
I love Jung Hoon.

372
00:24:00,111 --> 00:24:02,207
He's never lost my trust in three years and

373
00:24:02,208 --> 00:24:03,229
his sense of responsibility is strong too.

374
00:24:03,229 --> 00:24:05,288
That's why I'm telling you to just date him.

375
00:24:05,289 --> 00:24:07,225
Think of it as gaining experience and just date him.

376
00:24:07,226 --> 00:24:08,866
and when you get married, love doesn't have much to do with it anyways.

377
00:24:08,867 --> 00:24:12,194
Someone like you can marry a Doctor,
or even someone better than a Doctor!

378
00:24:12,195 --> 00:24:13,390
That's your delusion.

379
00:24:13,391 --> 00:24:14,904
Mom, you think that a teacher is great

380
00:24:14,904 --> 00:24:16,363
but people with money don't count teachers as being anything special.

381
00:24:16,363 --> 00:24:17,936
You're the one who should have more confidence.

382
00:24:17,937 --> 00:24:19,991
Women teachers are first when it comes to desirable potential daughters-in-law.

383
00:24:19,992 --> 00:24:22,392
And on top of that, your older sister's husband is a famous plastic surgeon in Gangnam.

384
00:24:22,393 --> 00:24:24,046
And your aunt is a day care director.

385
00:24:24,047 --> 00:24:25,520
They don't like girls from a single mother home

386
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:27,113
and even once the girls from such homes are married, they don't like them going home.

387
00:24:27,114 --> 00:24:30,211
An old 50 year old spinster aunt isn't positive.

388
00:24:30,212 --> 00:24:31,860
And on top of that Unnie's marriage isn't an honorable one.

389
00:24:31,861 --> 00:24:34,443
Are you badmouthing your sister and your aunt just so that you can side with that man?

390
00:24:34,444 --> 00:24:36,456
I'm not badmouthing them, I'm just telling you the reality.

391
00:24:36,457 --> 00:24:38,509
Do you think I decided on my marriage using only love?

392
00:24:38,510 --> 00:24:39,945
So you having done that you decide on not a large corporation

393
00:24:39,945 --> 00:24:41,240
but a kid working at some small company?

394
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:43,041
Jung Hoon is someone who can accept our family's situation.

395
00:24:43,042 --> 00:24:44,371
He won't betray us either.

396
00:24:44,372 --> 00:24:47,496
I don't want to live my whole life being suspicious of someone, like you Mom.

397
00:24:47,496 --> 00:24:48,569
Good job

398
00:24:48,570 --> 00:24:51,032
Are you looking at your mother that gave birth to you with the same eyes that everyone else looks at me with?

399
00:24:51,033 --> 00:24:52,897
At times, being objective is good for a relationship.

400
00:24:52,898 --> 00:24:55,519
So stop criticizing Jung Hoon. I'm supposed to go give my greetings to his family tomorrow.

401
00:24:55,520 --> 00:24:56,664
The wench that's supposed to be looking at things objectively

402
00:24:56,664 --> 00:24:58,836
going to give her greetings first to the man's family, which country's manners is that?

403
00:24:58,837 --> 00:25:00,246
If you agreed to get married of course you're supposed to go to the woman's family

404
00:25:00,246 --> 00:25:01,515
first to get permission!

405
00:25:01,515 --> 00:25:03,124
What big sister said is right

406
00:25:03,125 --> 00:25:05,561
Then should I tell him to come tomorrow?
- Your sister is coming tomorrow.

407
00:25:05,562 --> 00:25:08,211
I'm going to decide through a family meeting whether to accept him or not.

408
00:25:08,212 --> 00:25:09,901
What is the family deciding on my marriage?!

409
00:25:09,902 --> 00:25:12,647
If you want to do it according to your will leave and just live by yourselves, the two of you.

410
00:25:12,648 --> 00:25:15,448
If you go into the marriage alone I'm sure you'll live well.

411
00:25:15,449 --> 00:25:16,803
Are you cursing me right now?

412
00:25:18,849 --> 00:25:20,716
This is the price for freaking me out in the middle of the night.

413
00:25:20,717 --> 00:25:22,360
The earlier one was because the hand flew out due to my rude child.

414
00:25:27,391 --> 00:25:30,685
Today in commemoration of Jung Hoon getting married, one shot.

415
00:25:38,050 --> 00:25:39,808
How do you feel?
- About what?

416
00:25:39,809 --> 00:25:43,612
What? You jerk! You're getting me all riled me up.
- Oh, Hyung. Nothing happened.

417
00:25:47,031 --> 00:25:48,100
We haven't done it yet.

418
00:25:48,101 --> 00:25:50,638
It's the first time I've seen someone be innocent until this age.

419
00:25:50,639 --> 00:25:52,785
Is it nice to do it with a girl you love?

420
00:25:52,786 --> 00:25:54,058
Nothing's happened

421
00:25:54,059 --> 00:25:55,346
Oh, he's so annoying.

422
00:25:55,346 --> 00:25:57,862
You're lying in case Hye Yoon embarrassed, right?

423
00:26:00,105 --> 00:26:02,097
There's no innocence like that left to me now, Ki Joong.

424
00:26:02,098 --> 00:26:03,963
Do you know how bitter that is?

425
00:26:03,964 --> 00:26:05,571
I have no fantasy when it comes to women.

426
00:26:05,572 --> 00:26:07,674
This wench or that wench, they all seem the same.

427
00:26:07,675 --> 00:26:09,361
Don't curse, Hyung.

428
00:26:09,362 --> 00:26:11,453
He's like that because he gets rejected all the time everyday.

429
00:26:11,454 --> 00:26:13,275
When are you saying that I got rejected?!

430
00:26:13,276 --> 00:26:14,971
You guys are bad.

431
00:26:15,530 --> 00:26:17,545
As expected there's only Do Hyun for me.

432
00:26:17,546 --> 00:26:20,174
I'd better call Do Hyun.

433
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:25,590
What hyung? - I'm lonely, come out

434
00:26:25,591 --> 00:26:27,438
Who's there?

435
00:26:27,439 --> 00:26:28,752
yeah

436
00:26:28,787 --> 00:26:31,862
I can't come out now, I drank too much

437
00:26:32,905 --> 00:26:36,883
We're going riding tomorrow. We can see each other then.

438
00:26:36,918 --> 00:26:38,437
Don't be mad.

439
00:26:39,949 --> 00:26:41,833
You're going riding tomorrow?
- Yeah.

440
00:26:41,834 --> 00:26:43,999
Mom told us we should come because of the family meeting.

441
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:46,905
- Because of your sister's marriage?
- Mom is not satisfied with it.

442
00:26:46,906 --> 00:26:48,585
Why does she not like him without even seeing him?

443
00:26:48,586 --> 00:26:50,499
If it's Jung Hoon, he won't feel inferior to Sister-in-law too much.

444
00:26:50,500 --> 00:26:51,582
He is better than she is.

445
00:26:51,583 --> 00:26:53,047
What is wrong with Hye Yoon?

446
00:26:53,048 --> 00:26:55,521
Your sister is fine, but your mother isn't.

447
00:29:13,872 --> 00:29:15,571
Why, can't you come?

448
00:29:15,572 --> 00:29:18,853
-Was the meeting today, I didn't know

449
00:29:18,854 --> 00:29:20,822
How does somebody who is going to marry not know?

450
00:29:20,823 --> 00:29:22,757
Alright let's go to the house quickly.

451
00:29:23,300 --> 00:29:26,537
I'll sleep a little more because I drank before I got home.

452
00:29:26,538 --> 00:29:28,417
You didn't go home but went to drink?

453
00:29:28,418 --> 00:29:30,338
Are you really going to be like that?

454
00:29:30,339 --> 00:29:32,709
Are you listening to what I'm saying right now?

455
00:29:33,514 --> 00:29:34,743
Alright, sleep

456
00:29:38,837 --> 00:29:41,242
Please break up or get married. Do one of the two.

457
00:29:41,243 --> 00:29:44,863
-I'm not getting married you know-

458
00:29:44,864 --> 00:29:47,586
Do you think Jung Hoon said he wants to get married because he wanted to?

459
00:29:59,919 --> 00:30:01,594
I told you not to come, why did you come?

460
00:30:02,961 --> 00:30:04,907
What's your reason for being like this suddenly?

461
00:30:05,449 --> 00:30:07,785
You won't pick up my calls and eat alone

462
00:30:08,247 --> 00:30:10,409
This is for the time we've been together

463
00:30:12,608 --> 00:30:14,031
Hye Yoon.

464
00:30:14,878 --> 00:30:17,446
I don't have time,

465
00:30:20,277 --> 00:30:22,765
If we are going to break up, let's know the reason.

466
00:30:23,393 --> 00:30:25,924
I know you didn't love me

467
00:30:25,925 --> 00:30:27,606
Why, why do you think that?

468
00:30:28,107 --> 00:30:31,126
It has been three years since we have met and I am 29 years old.

469
00:30:31,127 --> 00:30:35,453
You know too that people are very harsh towards the age of a woman who hasn't married.

470
00:30:35,454 --> 00:30:38,542
But you don't have much consideration towards a woman's age.

471
00:30:39,034 --> 00:30:40,807
Is it because of how I told you that we should marry after two years?

472
00:30:40,808 --> 00:30:42,814
Why can't we marry now if we can marry after two years?

473
00:30:43,698 --> 00:30:46,642
Right now, it hasn't been a long time since I got my job.

474
00:30:46,642 --> 00:30:49,428
I didn't have time to prepare the wedding

475
00:30:49,429 --> 00:30:51,201
Either you don't love me

476
00:30:51,202 --> 00:30:53,838
or even if you did love me, it is too weak.

477
00:30:53,839 --> 00:30:56,128
It can't be love that passes over reality.

478
00:30:56,129 --> 00:30:57,184
Then we can get married

479
00:30:57,185 --> 00:30:59,891
I don't want to be bowed down to and served. You don't want to but only I want to...

480
00:31:02,867 --> 00:31:04,115
I'm sorry

481
00:31:06,032 --> 00:31:07,692
Should I try doing that like you did?

482
00:31:07,693 --> 00:31:09,816
Do it. If he holds on, it is love.

483
00:31:09,817 --> 00:31:11,754
I learned that the first time I dated.

484
00:31:11,755 --> 00:31:14,467
-Sang Ji sunbae? He was really awesome

485
