511
00:32:49,041 --> 00:32:51,102
Honey, after we get him to marry, let's go on a vacation.

512
00:32:51,102 --> 00:32:52,545
Let's go on a cruise. I want to go.

513
00:32:52,546 --> 00:32:54,620
Oh Mom. It's nauseating listening to your nasal voice from first thing in the morning.

514
