515
00:32:57,886 --> 00:33:00,059
Honey, when is he going to get married?

516
00:33:00,060 --> 00:33:02,677
-Once you're gone we came live well

517
00:33:02,678 --> 00:33:03,691
It's anger inducing, right?

518
00:33:03,692 --> 00:33:06,986
Mom, don't be like that. How old are you? My Hye Yoon is so mature too.

519
00:33:06,987 --> 00:33:08,763
You are taking Hye Yoon's side already.

520
00:33:08,764 --> 00:33:10,925
Anyways, I won't hate Hae Yeon

521
00:33:10,926 --> 00:33:12,761
