-No I just didn't tell you

532
00:33:33,817 --> 00:33:36,817
You keep changing more

533
00:33:36,818 --> 00:33:38,733
I am not siding with her. It is the truth.

534
00:33:39,081 --> 00:33:41,366
You said Hye Yoon's elder sister's husband is a plastic surgeon, right?

535
00:33:41,367 --> 00:33:44,279
-Yes
- He's Dad's college alumnus also and he knows Aunt too.

536
00:33:44,279 --> 00:33:45,841
