548
00:34:14,731 --> 00:34:16,533
Can't you raise the kid more independently?

549
00:34:16,534 --> 00:34:18,428
Tae Won is a sensitive and exquisite child.

550
00:34:18,429 --> 00:34:20,760
Scolding him like you is worse for him.

551
00:34:22,261 --> 00:34:23,791
The rice is too sticky.

552
