562
00:35:18,569 --> 00:35:21,274
The blood in your mother's veins must flow in yours too.

563
00:35:27,490 --> 00:35:28,841
Hello?

564
00:35:28,842 --> 00:35:31,459
Yes mom, we were going to go right now.

565
00:35:32,026 --> 00:35:34,698
Tae Won's dad said he couldn't go. He is beside me.

566
00:35:34,733 --> 00:35:36,367
(mouthing "how can you tell her that I'm here?")

567
00:35:36,368 --> 00:35:37,798
She told me to put you on the phone.

568
00:35:41,827 --> 00:35:43,054
Hello?

569
