576
00:36:05,973 --> 00:36:09,022
After coming home from showering, I thought I should change up my room.

577
00:36:09,414 --> 00:36:11,785
Write here Jung Hoon's resident registration number

578
00:36:11,785 --> 00:36:13,941
and his father and mother's resident registration number.

579
00:36:13,942 --> 00:36:16,258
