580
00:36:16,259 --> 00:36:17,229
Then find out.

581
00:36:17,230 --> 00:36:18,985
- Why?
- I want to see his fate and marital compatibility.

582
00:36:18,986 --> 00:36:20,394
Why do parents go into finding his fate?

583
00:36:20,395 --> 00:36:23,010
Just finding his fate is not accurate. You need to put everything in.

584
