587
00:36:28,416 --> 00:36:30,096
You even went on potential marriage dates without him knowing.

588
00:36:30,097 --> 00:36:33,142
Going on that blind date was something I did just for checks and balances.

589
00:36:33,143 --> 00:36:35,279
It's enough that I listened to your wishes until now.

590
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:37,668
Postpone your decision to the end.

591
00:36:37,669 --> 00:36:40,016
Even if you go to him, do as I tell you.

592
00:36:40,017 --> 00:36:42,315
That way you will be able to be treated well in their house.

593
00:36:42,316 --> 00:36:45,006
Look at your sister. She is a doctor's wife.

594
00:36:45,007 --> 00:36:49,584
Mom, I don't want to live as somebody's wife but in my own name! Jeong Hye Yoon!

595
00:36:50,068 --> 00:36:52,440
What a bunch of nonsense...

596
00:36:52,441 --> 00:36:53,623
Just find out about the numbers and write it down!

597
00:37:31,395 --> 00:37:32,782
You came?

598
00:37:33,483 --> 00:37:35,640
I have given some thought about us.

599
00:37:37,153 --> 00:37:39,843
Make me some bean sprouts soup.
I drank a lot last night.

600
00:37:41,630 --> 00:37:43,191
Give me money so I can buy bean sprouts.

601
00:37:43,192 --> 00:37:44,901
Don't you even have any money to buy some bean sprouts?

602
00:37:44,902 --> 00:37:47,164
Not everyone is as rich as you are.

603
00:37:47,165 --> 00:37:49,463
I didn't say anything until now
because I didn't want to seem cheap,

604
00:37:49,464 --> 00:37:51,453
but there have been many times
in which I used my own money on you.

605
00:37:57,520 --> 00:38:00,477
These are only the things
I've received you this past five years.

606
00:38:01,348 --> 00:38:03,949
I've never once schemed anything
the whole time we were dating.

607
00:38:04,681 --> 00:38:07,333
Are you really that envious of Jung Hoon and Hye Yoon getting married?

608
00:38:07,985 --> 00:38:09,256
Yes I envy them.

609
00:38:09,257 --> 00:38:12,111
I loved you with all my might
and you told me that you know that.

610
00:38:12,112 --> 00:38:13,913
but, why are my feelings hitting a brick wall?

611
00:38:14,555 --> 00:38:16,415
If you envy them, you lose.

612
00:38:16,416 --> 00:38:18,494
I am no longer allowed to be used.

613
00:38:20,010 --> 00:38:22,135
You're showing me the all time low yesterday and today.

614
00:38:22,136 --> 00:38:24,118
You calculated when you said you loved me.

615
00:38:24,119 --> 00:38:26,866
If you didn't caculated it through, a word like 'used' can't be said.

616
00:38:27,614 --> 00:38:29,900
Women can't been underestimated.

617
00:38:31,237 --> 00:38:34,946
Yes, you must be happy you are constantly mean.

618
00:38:34,947 --> 00:38:38,082
I'm not coming to this house again, you terrible bastard, Gong Ki Joong.

619
00:38:40,747 --> 00:38:43,651
Looking at how you are acting, you will be back in a week.

620
00:38:43,651 --> 00:38:44,925
I bet 10 wons that you'll be back.

621
00:38:47,196 --> 00:38:49,877
If you didn't have any feelings left for me, you shouldn't have come here.

622
00:38:50,428 --> 00:38:53,675
You came here to tease me. You want me to hold on to you, right?

623
00:39:29,520 --> 00:39:30,603
What's up, Dong Bi?

624
00:39:30,604 --> 00:39:32,985
I did as you said and I got ruined.

625
00:39:34,839 --> 00:39:37,339
Isn't it tiring to do that every single time you drink coffee?

626
00:39:37,340 --> 00:39:40,106
Buy an espresso machine. There are $200-$300 ones.

627
00:39:40,107 --> 00:39:42,274
You are saying that because you don't know this taste very well.

628
00:39:42,275 --> 00:39:45,270
There's a sentiment that's felt as you make it.

629
00:39:45,271 --> 00:39:47,397
What sentiment are you looking for as you make coffee?

630
00:39:48,897 --> 00:39:51,720
- Why isn't your husband coming?
- He went biking.

631
00:39:51,721 --> 00:39:53,646
Isn't he a crazy bastard?

632
00:39:53,647 --> 00:39:55,895
He's no longer a teen, but a 40yr old man, married with a kid.

633
00:39:55,896 --> 00:39:57,440
Do you want to die?

634
00:39:57,441 --> 00:39:59,027
No matter what I tell him, he won't listen.

635
00:39:59,565 --> 00:40:02,569
- Does he have another woman?
- What do you mean something else?

636
00:40:02,570 --> 00:40:04,919
Ask him to put the house under your name.

637
00:40:04,920 --> 00:40:06,810
Starts by putting all his wealth under your name one by one.

638
00:40:06,811 --> 00:40:09,304
Mom, is not as if they were
having problems right now

639
00:40:09,305 --> 00:40:10,894
then, why are you trying to prepare her for a divorce?

640
00:40:10,895 --> 00:40:13,384
He already broken up its family once.
You don't think that he can do it twice?

641
00:40:13,385 --> 00:40:14,985
What bad comes out of preparing early?

642
00:40:16,390 --> 00:40:17,976
Were you surprised that I asked to see you?

643
00:40:17,977 --> 00:40:19,104
No.

644
00:40:19,104 --> 00:40:21,616
I didn't think this would be awkward
since we have met a few times through Ki Joon...

645
00:40:21,617 --> 00:40:23,065
It is a little bit awkward.

646
00:40:23,066 --> 00:40:25,906
I'm fine, Do Hyun. Please take good care of me.

647
00:40:25,907 --> 00:40:27,753
I heard you wanted to get married to my sister in law.

648
00:40:28,312 --> 00:40:30,393
