658
00:40:54,289 --> 00:40:56,819
The fact is, I'm a little bit nervous but,
you don't like me?

659
00:40:56,820 --> 00:40:59,195
So is this how you are expressing your objection?

660
00:40:59,196 --> 00:41:01,422
Yes, this must sound weird to you.

661
00:41:01,423 --> 00:41:03,623
It must seem like I'm gossiping
about my mother in law when

662
00:41:03,623 --> 00:41:05,571
