663
00:41:06,272 --> 00:41:07,956
But if you still want to marry, do it.

664
00:41:07,957 --> 00:41:10,130
However, I have told you early.

665
00:41:10,843 --> 00:41:13,398
If it had been somebody I didn't know, I would have ignored them.

666
00:41:13,399 --> 00:41:16,646
I couldn't just let it go because you are Ki Joong's little brother.

667
00:41:28,614 --> 00:41:29,850
Yes, Dong Bi.

668
00:41:30,281 --> 00:41:31,552
I can't go out right now.

669
00:41:31,553 --> 00:41:34,169
There is a family meeting today because of Hye Yoon's marriage.

670
00:41:34,170 --> 00:41:36,457
What are you doing? Do you want to come?

671
00:41:36,457 --> 00:41:39,259
Since I am not family, I can't come.

672
00:41:39,873 --> 00:41:42,000
Mother will say something to me.

673
00:41:42,001 --> 00:41:43,943
It's alright. I'll hang up now.

674
00:42:01,036 --> 00:42:03,133
Who was it to call on a day like this?

675
00:42:03,134 --> 00:42:04,299
Dong Bi.

676
00:42:04,300 --> 00:42:06,698
Why is she calling again?
That awful wench!

677
00:42:06,699 --> 00:42:10,366
Mom don't act harshly towards Dong Bi, she is my friend, not your daughter.

678
00:42:10,367 --> 00:42:12,536
She introduced Jung Hoon!

679
00:42:12,537 --> 00:42:14,383
If she liked him, why didn't she date him? Why did she introduce him to you?

680
00:42:14,384 --> 00:42:15,952
Mom, Dong Bi is dating somebody.

681
00:42:15,953 --> 00:42:18,137
He is a man you like. He is rich and he is intelligent.

682
00:42:18,138 --> 00:42:20,761
-Keeping a man like that to herself and...
But he is a confirmed bachelor..

683
00:42:21,891 --> 00:42:23,937
A dummy being a dummy, right?

684
00:42:23,938 --> 00:42:27,007
All the men act like that.
They have everything calculated!

685
00:42:27,008 --> 00:42:30,621
Jung Hoon is a good choice for Hae Yoon.
More than anything, he's a good guy.

686
00:42:30,621 --> 00:42:32,970
If anything happen, is Junh Hoo's loss.

687
00:42:32,971 --> 00:42:34,007
What?

688
00:42:34,667 --> 00:42:37,942
Do you know how hard it is to be normal? He is normal.

689
00:42:37,943 --> 00:42:39,453
He isn't normal, aunt.

690
00:42:39,454 --> 00:42:40,509
There is peace within the family.

691
00:42:40,509 --> 00:42:42,482
Tae Won's dad said their family is amazing.

692
00:42:42,483 --> 00:42:45,340
- They are respected as doctors too.
- What can you do with respect?

693
00:42:45,341 --> 00:42:47,273
What kind of money could he have earned being a Pediatric?

694
00:42:47,274 --> 00:42:50,241
No, mom. They do pretty well.
They are rich without being conceited of it.

695
00:42:50,242 --> 00:42:51,853
And his father is a good man.

696
00:42:51,854 --> 00:42:54,701
You can see a man's future through their father.

697
00:42:55,499 --> 00:42:57,018
How does your husband know their family?

698
00:42:57,019 --> 00:42:59,000
He bikes with Jung Hoon's brother.

699
00:42:59,001 --> 00:43:00,497
They are crazy bastards, aren't they?

700
00:43:00,498 --> 00:43:02,041
Does he ride the bike too?

701
00:43:02,042 --> 00:43:03,480
I like that about him.

702
00:43:04,850 --> 00:43:06,835
So, Do Hyun said all that?

703
00:43:06,836 --> 00:43:08,527
Then it means he is alright.

704
00:43:08,528 --> 00:43:10,399
He said so.

705
00:43:13,629 --> 00:43:15,774
Then bring him home.
Fast, without wasting time!

706
00:43:15,775 --> 00:43:16,855
Okay!

707
00:43:18,317 --> 00:43:20,330
Does she like him that much?

708
00:43:25,666 --> 00:43:27,640
Mother approved and told me you should come.

709
00:43:28,141 --> 00:43:29,356
That's good.

710
00:43:29,874 --> 00:43:31,202
You say it like it's other people's business.

711
00:43:31,202 --> 00:43:33,023
You have a talent towards tiring people.

712
00:43:33,024 --> 00:43:34,700
It is because I just came home and I am tired.

713
00:43:34,701 --> 00:43:36,949
You went out? Where? Who did you meet?

714
00:43:36,950 --> 00:43:39,149
- Jung Hoon.
- Mom came in my room. I'll call you later.

715
00:43:39,150 --> 00:43:40,961
- Who was it?
- Hye Yoon.

716
00:43:40,962 --> 00:43:42,997
She says her mom approved and I should come tomorrow.

717
00:43:42,998 --> 00:43:46,466
What do you mean she approved? Where they dissatisfied with you?

718
00:43:47,087 --> 00:43:49,404
It's not like that. Why are you being so sensitive?

719
00:43:49,405 --> 00:43:50,640
You approved of Hye Yoon as well.

720
00:43:50,641 --> 00:43:52,916
It's because I called your aunt and heard some weird things.

721
00:43:52,917 --> 00:43:54,783
- About what?
- About Hye Yoon's sister.

722
00:43:56,254 --> 00:43:57,408
Why?

723
00:43:57,409 --> 00:43:59,642
