a married man to keep it by her side.

724
00:43:59,643 --> 00:44:01,460
My goodness I don't even want to talk about it.

725
00:44:01,461 --> 00:44:03,542
Why does aunt say such things without knowing anything?

726
00:44:03,543 --> 00:44:05,174
Aren't you the one who doesn't know anything?

727
00:44:05,175 --> 00:44:06,823
I heard your aunt found out not long ago.

728
00:44:06,824 --> 00:44:08,939
Even if that was the truth,
what does that have to do with Hae Yoon?

729
00:44:08,940 --> 00:44:10,431
It feels uncomfortable.

730
00:44:10,432 --> 00:44:12,387
Even though Hye Yoon wasn't the one who had an affair with a married man?

731
00:44:12,388 --> 00:44:14,024
Oh, it's disgusting.

732
00:44:14,025 --> 00:44:16,202
Trust your son, mom.

733
00:44:16,202 --> 00:44:17,965
You met Hye Yoon. You said she was nice.

734
00:44:17,966 --> 00:44:19,647
Only trust what you saw.

735
00:44:19,648 --> 00:44:22,121
You said her father was a civil servant before he passed away, right?

736
00:44:22,122 --> 00:44:24,643
- What was his rank?
- Don't be like a materialistic person.

737
00:44:24,678 --> 00:44:26,042
You are disappointing.

738
00:44:26,043 --> 00:44:28,762
After the talking of marriage has come up, you are disappointing me.

739
00:44:28,763 --> 00:44:32,048
Somebody said that a son who studies well is a country's son

740
00:44:32,049 --> 00:44:33,859
and a son who earns a lot of money is mother in law's son

741
00:44:33,860 --> 00:44:35,812
and a son with bad credit is my son.

742
00:44:36,303 --> 00:44:37,661
But you are my mom.

743
00:44:37,662 --> 00:44:40,875
You are my mom.

744
00:44:40,875 --> 00:44:42,761
Why do you keep comparing yourself to Hye Yoon?

745
00:44:42,762 --> 00:44:43,962
Why don't you have any confidence?

746
00:44:43,963 --> 00:44:45,528
You are teasing me.

747
00:44:47,456 --> 00:44:49,056
Mom.

748
00:45:05,412 --> 00:45:06,497
Why did you call me out?

749
00:45:06,498 --> 00:45:09,177
I hate having to go out when I'm already at home,
so why did you call me?

750
00:45:09,603 --> 00:45:11,280
Am I ugly?

751
00:45:11,781 --> 00:45:13,115
Did you fight with Ki Joong hyung again?

752
00:45:13,850 --> 00:45:15,506
We split up.

753
00:45:15,507 --> 00:45:16,933
Please do that.

754
00:45:16,934 --> 00:45:20,435
He said that he will bet ‎₩10 that I will come back to him again.

755
00:45:20,436 --> 00:45:22,599
Which means I am worth ten cents.

756
00:45:23,106 --> 00:45:24,762
A beer, please.

757
00:45:27,009 --> 00:45:28,267
What's wrong?

758
00:45:30,376 --> 00:45:32,103
I don't feel well today either.

759
00:45:36,117 --> 00:45:37,698
What are you doing?

760
00:45:37,699 --> 00:45:40,153
Why don't I feel anything?

761
00:45:40,388 --> 00:45:43,545
Why doesn't my heart flutter with just anyone?

762
00:45:44,096 --> 00:45:46,508
Wow, that's low,

763
00:45:47,130 --> 00:45:48,876
Seriously. Wow...

764
00:45:49,679 --> 00:45:51,313
A beer, please.

765
00:46:06,296 --> 00:46:07,483
What are you doing?

766
00:46:07,484 --> 00:46:09,451
Jung Hoon said he would call back, but he isn't.

767
00:46:09,452 --> 00:46:10,829
Then you should call him.

768
00:46:10,830 --> 00:46:12,213
It would seem like I am sad.

769
00:46:12,214 --> 00:46:13,791
You quibble over such little things.

770
00:46:13,792 --> 00:46:16,723
What does Jung Hoon like? Unni said she needs to know so she can shop.

771
00:46:16,724 --> 00:46:19,673
He likes meat. Aunt, has Dong Bi called yet?

772
00:46:19,674 --> 00:46:21,868
Yes, I think something is up with her.

773
00:46:21,869 --> 00:46:23,989
Why doesn't she talk about her family?

774
00:46:23,990 --> 00:46:25,852
I think she doesn't have a good relationship with her father.

775
00:46:25,853 --> 00:46:28,392
Her littler brother is not in Korea. She says he went to study abroad.

776
00:46:28,393 --> 00:46:30,632
If they can send him to study abroad, maybe they live well.

777
00:46:31,074 --> 00:46:32,410
Dong Bi says

778
00:46:32,411 --> 00:46:35,439
that her father, mother and littler brother are higher class and she is of the lower class.

779
00:46:35,440 --> 00:46:37,000
I think there is a secret behind her birth.

780
00:46:38,968 --> 00:46:41,925
How can a girl be this heavy? You should lose weight.

781
00:46:49,317 --> 00:46:50,725
Hello?

782
00:46:51,609 --> 00:46:53,051
Oh really?

783
00:46:53,725 --> 00:46:56,957
I split up. I split up like you said.

784
00:46:56,958 --> 00:46:58,532
So you two are happy?

785
00:47:00,282 --> 00:47:01,860
Who was it?

786
00:47:04,537 --> 00:47:07,548
Run! This is your maximum speed?

787
00:47:10,890 --> 00:47:12,664
Hey!

788
00:47:12,665 --> 00:47:15,396
- Aren't you pretending to be drunk?
- No!

789
00:47:22,487 --> 00:47:25,713
I feel so stuffy...
Seriously, you are so full of it.

790
00:47:25,748 --> 00:47:27,387
You can't even drink, but
you always act like you can.

791
00:47:28,117 --> 00:47:29,513
Go into the washroom quickly!

792
00:47:29,514 --> 00:47:31,065
It is hard to get up.

793
00:47:47,814 --> 00:47:49,613
When did she eat the squid?

794
00:47:59,848 --> 00:48:02,431
- My stomach hurts.
- What do you want me to do about it?

795
00:48:02,432 --> 00:48:05,025
Brew me some barley tea at the least.

796
00:48:05,026 --> 00:48:06,713
You awful wench...

797
00:48:07,914 --> 00:48:09,138
What is this all about?

798
00:48:09,138 --> 00:48:11,735
My head is ringing. Open the door already!

799
00:48:11,736 --> 00:48:13,644
Please stop ringing the door bell!

800
00:48:20,269 --> 00:48:22,175
- Hye Yoon.
- Why are you here?

801
00:48:37,313 --> 00:48:39,557
You told me you you were going to call,
but you don't even call me...

802
00:48:39,558 --> 00:48:40,936
And you were here all this time?

803
00:48:41,555 --> 00:48:42,983
Why is your shirt off?

804
00:48:47,837 --> 00:48:49,090
My head hurts.

805
00:48:49,715 --> 00:48:51,245
Put on some clothes!

806
00:48:51,246 --> 00:48:53,393
Just what are you imagining right now?

807
00:48:53,394 --> 00:48:54,895
What do you mean what am I imagining?

808
00:48:58,125 --> 00:48:59,205
Are you crazy?

809
00:49:01,623 --> 00:49:03,858
I'm sorry. You shouldn't have hugged me!

810
00:49:03,859 --> 00:49:06,163
Hey! It hurts!

811
00:49:06,164 --> 00:49:07,408
Seriously, it hurts!

812
00:49:07,408 --> 00:49:09,114
I hit you so you would hurt. How could you push me away?

813
00:49:09,115 --> 00:49:11,022
I said I made a mistake because I was surprised.

814
00:49:11,023 --> 00:49:13,889
Hye Yoon, don't get married to him. If he is taken aback, he will probably hit you too.

815
00:49:13,890 --> 00:49:15,604
Hey, that's not it!

816
00:49:15,605 --> 00:49:17,574
No, Hye Yoon. I will never lay a hand on you.

817
00:49:17,574 --> 00:49:19,217
- Even now, Dong Bi...
- Could you two please fight with your clothes on?

818
00:49:19,218 --> 00:49:21,009
Aren't you guys embarrassed even with your clothes off?

819
00:49:29,539 --> 00:49:31,530
Today is such a bad day.

820
00:49:31,531 --> 00:49:34,823
Getting dump and make me feel suspicious
from hugging someone I feel nothing for.

821
00:49:34,824 --> 00:49:36,272
I didn't suspect you of anything.

822
00:49:41,180 --> 00:49:42,246
What number is this?

823
00:49:42,246 --> 00:49:43,735
It's such a long number. Could it be an international call?

824
00:49:48,225 --> 00:49:49,391
You make ramen.

825
00:49:49,392 --> 00:49:51,074
You are going to eat again after having thrown up everything you ate?

826
00:49:51,075 --> 00:49:54,162
- Are you a beast?
- If I don't do this, I can't live.

827
00:49:54,162 --> 00:49:55,812
Do you guys know hardships?

828
00:50:12,231 --> 00:50:13,896
Why did you call when I'm going to meet you anyways later?

829
00:50:14,907 --> 00:50:17,102
Why do you ask me where is Dong Bi ?

830
00:50:17,103 --> 00:50:18,777
She hasn't been picking for several days

831
00:50:18,778 --> 00:50:20,680
and she hasn't been going to work. I am worried.

832
00:50:21,320 --> 00:50:23,493
I was wondering if she called you.

833
00:50:23,494 --> 00:50:25,720
Why would she call me if she didn't call you?

834
00:50:26,613 --> 00:50:28,379
You two meet up without me knowing.

835
00:50:28,380 --> 00:50:30,861
Do you know how surprised I was when I saw you two were naked?

836
00:50:30,862 --> 00:50:33,041
Do you think I did it because I wanted to? It was all because of you.

837
00:50:33,042 --> 00:50:34,825
Why did you make her do something like that?

838
00:50:34,826 --> 00:50:36,712
What are you saying that I made her do?

839
00:50:36,713 --> 00:50:39,969
There is no correct answer in a relationship.
Why did you tell her to break up with him?

840
00:50:39,970 --> 00:50:41,907
You should've just left them alone to do whatever they wanted.

841
00:50:41,908 --> 00:50:43,953
Then in the end, it is harder on Dong Bi's part.

842
00:50:43,954 --> 00:50:45,335
You think she's having fun now?

843
00:50:45,336 --> 00:50:47,840
I have to go.
I'm going to get in trouble for talking on the phone too much.

844
00:50:50,468 --> 00:50:51,945
You think that you are the only person who has married?

845
00:50:51,946 --> 00:50:53,449
Keep it to a minimum.
It is not good to do that at work.

846
00:50:53,450 --> 00:50:55,463
-I'm sorry.
-Shut up!

847
00:51:01,815 --> 00:51:04,402
Aunt, Dong Bi isn't picking up.

848
00:51:04,403 --> 00:51:07,377
Can't do anything because
I have to meet Jung Hoon and bring him home

849
00:51:07,378 --> 00:51:09,150
Can you go to Dong Bi's house?

850
00:51:10,767 --> 00:51:12,487
Can't you leave work a little early?

851
00:53:17,758 --> 00:53:19,002
Dong Bi!

852
00:53:19,542 --> 00:53:21,794
I know you are in there. Open the door!

853
00:53:23,565 --> 00:53:25,043
Dong Bi!

854
00:53:26,863 --> 00:53:28,612
Dong Bi!

855
00:53:35,704 --> 00:53:38,592
Does the pediatrician Ha Dong Gun live in this neighborhood?

856
00:53:40,513 --> 00:53:42,869
Yes, he lives here. That is the house.

857
00:53:42,870 --> 00:53:45,233
They have a very nice character.

858
00:53:45,234 --> 00:53:47,294
And the Madame is an angel.
